meta {
  name: Clone Radiology Test List
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-test-lists/{{branchRadiologyTestListId}}/clone
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Franchise Pricing"
  }
}

docs {
  🔒 **RBAC:** requires `branch_admin:lab_test_list__clone_list` — enforced by
  `PermissionGuard`; admins bypass, so `{{businessAccessToken}}` succeeds.

  Deep-copy an existing list (and all its test rows, preserving each row's
  `listPrice` and variant flags) into a new independent list. Business JWT. Editing
  the clone never affects the original.

  Fields: `name` (**required**, ≤120) — unique per branch among active lists (409
  `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_LIST_NAME_CONFLICT` on clash). 404
  `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_LIST_NOT_FOUND` if the source list isn't a live list in
  the active branch.
}
